<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Tambang Timah H1 net drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Tambang Timah H1 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			     (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Sales				 289.90    vs   283.88</p>
<p>    Gross profit			112.12    vs   124.11</p>
<p>    Operating income		   70.18    vs    78.17</p>
<p>    Pre-tax income		     82.97    vs    98.20</p>
<p>    Net profit			   57.30    vs    70.58</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)   114    vs	140</p>
<p>Note: The results were subject to only a limited review which is substantially less in scope than an audit. PT Tambang Timah is an integrated tin mining firm.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
